{
  "title": "FútVal — métricas del backend",
  "uid": "futval-http-metrics",
  "tags": [
    "futval",
    "opcional"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 23,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-2h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Negocio — Resumen del período",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Operaciones",
      "description": "Operaciones de escritura de negocio en el período del dashboard (compras, ventas, órdenes, alertas, sincronizaciones, recálculos, estrategias). No incluye login, registro ni API keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(business_operations_total{operation!~\"USER_REGISTERED|USER_LOGGED_IN|API_KEY_ISSUED\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "operaciones",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "% de rechazos",
      "description": "Operaciones de negocio rechazadas por una regla de negocio o fallidas de forma inesperada, sobre el total del período. Verde por debajo del 10 %, amarillo hasta el 30 % y rojo después. Sin login, registro ni API keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "sin datos",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "value": null,
                "color": "green"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.1,
                "color": "yellow"
              },
              {
                "value": 0.3,
                "color": "red"
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(business_operations_total{outcome!=\"success\",operation!~\"USER_REGISTERED|USER_LOGGED_IN|API_KEY_ISSUED\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(business_operations_total{operation!~\"USER_REGISTERED|USER_LOGGED_IN|API_KEY_ISSUED\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "rechazos",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tokens",
      "description": "Tokens operados en el período por compras y ventas registradas (market_tokens_traded_total, compra y venta juntas).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(market_tokens_traded_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "tokens",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Créditos",
      "description": "Volumen operado en créditos en el período (market_volume_credits_total): la suma de cantidad × precio de cada cruce, compra y venta juntas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(market_volume_credits_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "créditos",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Precio / token",
      "description": "Precio promedio por token operado en el período: volumen en créditos ÷ tokens operados. Si sube o baja sin que cambie la cantidad, el mercado se está moviendo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "sin datos",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(market_volume_credits_total[$__range])) / sum(increase(market_tokens_traded_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "precio",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Conexiones SSE",
      "description": "Conexiones abiertas del stream de notificaciones en tiempo real en este momento (sse_connections_active).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sse_connections_active)",
          "legendFormat": "conexiones",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Negocio — Mercado",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operaciones por resultado",
      "description": "Operaciones de negocio por minuto a lo largo del tiempo, por resultado: success = aceptada, rejected = rechazada por una regla de negocio, unexpected = fallida de forma inesperada. La columna Total de la leyenda suma el período. Sin login, registro ni API keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "success"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "green"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "rejected"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "yellow"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "unexpected"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(business_operations_total{operation!~\"USER_REGISTERED|USER_LOGGED_IN|API_KEY_ISSUED\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Operaciones por tipo",
      "description": "Cuántas veces ocurrió cada operación de negocio en el período, de mayor a menor. Sin login, registro ni API keys.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "valueMode": "text",
        "namePlacement": "left",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "sizing": "manual",
        "minVizHeight": 18,
        "maxVizHeight": 36,
        "minVizWidth": 8,
        "text": {
          "titleSize": 13,
          "valueSize": 20
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (operation) (round(increase(business_operations_total{operation!~\"USER_REGISTERED|USER_LOGGED_IN|API_KEY_ISSUED\"}[$__range]))) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens por lado del iniciador",
      "description": "Tokens operados por minuto a lo largo del tiempo, por el lado de la orden que inicia el cruce (buy o sell). La columna Total de la leyenda suma el período. Una compra que toma una venta ya publicada suma sólo en buy, así que sell suele ser menor: no significa que haya habido pocas ventas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "noValue": "0",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "buy"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "blue"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "sell"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "orange"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (side) (increase(market_tokens_traded_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{side}}",
          "interval": "1m"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Negocio — Alertas y notificaciones",
      "collapsed": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 34,
          "type": "stat",
          "title": "Alertas de precio disparadas",
          "description": "Alertas de precio disparadas dentro del rango del dashboard (alerts_triggered_total).",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 6,
            "x": 0,
            "y": 23
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "decimals": 0,
              "noValue": "0"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "options": {
            "reduceOptions": {
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull"
              ],
              "fields": "",
              "values": false
            },
            "colorMode": "value",
            "graphMode": "none",
            "textMode": "value_and_name",
            "orientation": "auto"
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "${datasource}"
              },
              "expr": "sum(increase(alerts_triggered_total[$__range]))",
              "legendFormat": "alertas",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "type": "bargauge",
          "title": "Notificaciones por entrega",
          "description": "Notificaciones creadas dentro del rango del dashboard: live = llegó al usuario conectado, stored_only = quedó guardada porque no estaba conectado.",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 9,
            "x": 6,
            "y": 23
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "decimals": 0,
              "min": 0,
              "noValue": "0",
              "color": {
                "mode": "fixed",
                "fixedColor": "blue"
              }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "live"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "green"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "stored_only"
                },
                "properties": [
                  {
                    "id": "color",
                    "value": {
                      "mode": "fixed",
                      "fixedColor": "blue"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "reduceOptions": {
              "calcs": [
                "lastNotNull"
              ],
              "fields": "",
              "values": false
            },
            "orientation": "horizontal",
            "displayMode": "basic",
            "valueMode": "text",
            "namePlacement": "left",
            "showUnfilled": true,
            "sizing": "manual",
            "minVizHeight": 18,
            "maxVizHeight": 36,
            "minVizWidth": 8,
            "text": {
              "titleSize": 13,
              "valueSize": 20
            }
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "${datasource}"
              },
              "expr": "sum by (delivery) (round(increase(notifications_created_total[$__range])))",
              "legendFormat": "{{delivery}}",
              "instant": true,
              "range": false
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "type": "timeseries",
          "title": "Conexiones SSE abiertas en el tiempo",
          "description": "Conexiones abiertas del stream de notificaciones en tiempo real (sse_connections_active).",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "gridPos": {
            "h": 8,
            "w": 9,
            "x": 15,
            "y": 23
          },
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "decimals": 0,
              "min": 0,
              "noValue": "0"
            },
            "overrides": []
          },
          "targets": [
            {
              "refId": "A",
              "datasource": {
                "type": "prometheus",
                "uid": "${datasource}"
              },
              "expr": "sum(sse_connections_active)",
              "legendFormat": "conexiones"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "legend": {
              "displayMode": "list",
              "placement": "bottom",
              "calcs": []
            },
            "tooltip": {
              "mode": "multi",
              "sort": "desc"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Requests HTTP",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por ruta (segundos)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.95) sobre http_request_duration_seconds_bucket. Los streams (SSE) no entran al histograma.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de error 5xx por endpoint",
      "description": "Por cada endpoint, respuestas 5xx sobre sus requests totales (http_requests_total). Es la tasa de error del SLA. Solo aparecen los endpoints que devolvieron algún 5xx; si no hay ninguno el panel queda vacío, que es lo esperado. Los 4xx no cuentan: son errores del cliente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
